//www.donga.com/news/Politics/article/all/20261017/134858534/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"\"There is no such thing as a worthy of reverence sacrifice.\"","summary_en":"President Lee Jae-eun expressed his condolences to the family of one firefighter who died in a factory fire fighting on 17th, and promised that he would improve safety measures for firefighters as well as take post-mortem measures. He wrote on his X (X) account: \"I will not forget the sacrifice of the deceased.\" The president said: \"It is sad. I pray for the soul of the decedent.\"","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"부천 공장 화재 진압 중 심정지 40대 소방관 끝내 숨져","summary":"","date":"2026-10-17T01:31","link":"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/area/capital/1282835.html","outlet":"Hankyoreh","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"date_seen":true,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"Firefighter dies after cardiac arrest while fighting fire in Busan factory","summary_en":"","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Busan","la":35.102,"lo":129.03,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"도마뱀 밥 주러 64차례 부대 이탈한 장교…“정직 2개월 정당”","summary":"부하 병사들의 휴가 승인을 700여 차례 늦게 처리하고 폭언을 일삼은 데다 근무 시간에 수십 차례 부대를 무단이탈한 육군 장교에게 내려진 정직 2개월 처분은 정당하다는 법원 판단이 나왔다. 법원은 오히려 군 징계 규정상 파면까지 가능한 비위인데도 현저히 낮은 처분이 내려졌다고 지적했다.법조계에 따르면 부산지법 행정1-3부(부장판사 허준서)는 15일 육군 장교가 소속 부대장을 상대로 낸 정직 처분 취소 소송에서 원고의 청구를 기각했다. 2014년 임관한 이 장교는 한 여단 본부중대장 등으로 근무하면","date":"2026-10-17T01:30","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Society/article/all/20261017/134845053/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"\"The 64th Annual Alumni Awards\".","summary_en":"The court ruled that the two-month disciplinary action imposed on an army officer who had delayed approval of leave for his subordinates more than 700 times, abused them and left their units unauthorizedly dozens of times during duty was justified. The court pointed out that although it is a violation which could lead to dismissal under military discipline regulations, the measure was significantly lower. According to legal sources, Busan District Court Administrative Division 1-3 (He Jun Sook as Judge) rejected the claim by the plaintiff in the annulment of the disciplinary action against the commander of the unit he belonged to.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Busan","la":35.102,"lo":129.03,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"N. Korea conducts underwater test of new precision-guided torpedo using AI: KCNA","summary":"North Korea said Saturday it has conducted an underwater test of a new precision-guided torpedo weapon system, noting that the test heralds a \"significant\" change in the North's naval capabilities. North Korea test-fired the Zam-2.0 super-speed precision-guided torpedo weapon sys","date":"2026-10-17T01:28","link":"https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10905699","outlet":"The Korea Herald","lang":"en","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"national","title_en":"N. Korea conducts underwater test of new precision-guided torpedo using AI: KCNA","summary_en":"North Korea said Saturday it has conducted an underwater test of a new precision-guided torpedo weapon system, noting that the test heralds a \"significant\" change in the North's naval capabilities. North Korea test-fired the Zam-2.0 super-speed precision-guided torpedo weapon sys","mt":null,"geo":null},{"title":"李 “부천 화재 소방대원 순직에 참담…안전대책 보완·희생 걸맞은 예우”","summary":"이재명 대통령은 17일 경기 부천시의 공장 화재 현장에 투입됐다가 심정지 상태에 빠졌던 40대 소방관이 끝내 숨진 데 대해 “고인의 희생을 잊지 않겠다”고 했다.이 대통령은 이날 오전 X(옛 트위터)에 올린 글에서 “부천 화재 현장에서 임무를 수행하다 순직하신 소방대원의 소식에 참담한 마음입니다. 삼가 고인의 명복을 빈다”며 이같이 말했다.이어 “국민의 생명과 안전을 지키기 위해 위험한 현장에 나섰던 고인의 헌신을 깊이 새기겠다”고 했다.이 대통령은 “국민의 안전을 지키는 소방대원들의 안전은 국가","date":"2026-10-17T01:24","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Politics/article/all/20261017/134858504/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"\"The firefighters who died in Buchen's fire are sad...","summary_en":"President Lee Jae-eun said on 17th that he would not forget the sacrifice of a firefighter who died after being sent to a factory fire in Busan City, Gyeonggi Province. In his post on X (former Twitter), Lee said: \"I am saddened by the news of a fireman who was killed while performing his duties at the Busan fire scene. I wish him all the best.\" He added: \"The dedication of the dead man who went out into a dangerous area to protect the lives and safety of our countrymen will be deeply imprinted in my memory.\"","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Busan","la":35.102,"lo":129.03,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"트럼프 “현대, 조지아주에 7500억 투자 발표”…선거 유세서 성과 강조","summary":"","date":"2026-10-17T01:16","link":"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/international/international_general/1282839.html","outlet":"Hankyoreh","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"date_seen":true,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"Trump \"Hitachi, announced 750 billion investment in Georgia\"...","summary_en":"","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"화재로 숨진 소방관 올해 들어 4명…7년간 '위험직무 순직' 28명","summary":"(서울=연합뉴스) 차민지 홍준석 기자 = 부천 공장화재를 진압하기 위해 선착대로 투입됐다가 크게 다친 소방관이 끝내 숨지면서 올해 화재 현장에서...","date":"2026-10-17T01:10","link":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261017020800530","outlet":"Yonhap News (society)","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"Firefighters died in fire four times this year... 28 people \"hazardous work\" for seven years","summary_en":"(Seoul = Yonhap News Agency) Cha Min-ji Hong Jun-sik = A firefighter who was sent to suppress a factory fire in Busan, South Korea, and then seriously injured died after being...","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Busan","la":35.102,"lo":129.03,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"‘골드러시의 삽’인 줄 알았는데…네오클라우드 종말론 왜 나올까[딥다이브]","summary":"얼마 전까진 AI 시대를 이끌 혁신이라며 환호했는데, 갑자기 종말론이 판칩니다. 경고음이 울리면서 관련 주가가 일제히 폭락한 탓에 15일 코스피까지 주저앉았죠. 바로 ‘네오클라우드(Neocloud)’ 이야기인데요.AI 산업의 핵심 인프라는 데이터센터이고, 그 데이터센터에 대한 수요가 폭발적으로 증가한다는 건 기정사실 아니었나요? 왜 분위기가 180도 달라진 걸까요? AI 붐의 약한 고리, 네오클라우드 종말론을 들여다보겠습니다.*이 기사는 10월 16일(금요일) 발행한 딥다이브 뉴스레터의 온라인 기","date":"2026-10-17T01:00","link":"https://www.donga.com/news/Economy/article/all/20261016/134856189/1","outlet":"Dong-A Ilbo","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"I thought it was a shovel of the gold rush, but...","summary_en":"Until recently, the AI boom was hailed as a leading innovation in the age of artificial intelligence. But then suddenly apocalyptic beliefs began to spread. The alarm bell rang and all related stock prices fell, causing the CSE to fall on October 15th. It's Neocloud. Wasn't it already clear that data centers are the core infrastructure of the AI industry? And why did this change completely? Let's take a look at the weak link in the AI boom: Apocalyptic behaviour of neo-clouds. *This article appeared online in Deepdive Newsletter on Friday, October 16th","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":null},{"title":"경찰, '소방관 사망' 부천 공장화재 33명 수사전담팀 편성","summary":"(부천=연합뉴스) 권준우 기자 = 화재 진압에 나섰던 소방대원 1명이 숨지고 7명이 다친 경기 부천시 금속사출 도장공장 화재 사고의 원인과 책임...","date":"2026-10-17T00:56","link":"https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20261017019600061","outlet":"Yonhap News (society)","lang":"ko","via":"RSS","state":false,"tier":"local-language","title_en":"Police, 'firefighter' death Buchen factory fire 33 investigation team","summary_en":"(Busan = Yonhap News Agency) Journalist Jung Joon-wo = One firefighter died and seven others were injured in a Busan metal injection painting plant fire accident.","mt":"MADLAD-400 (Google open model, run in the refresh job)","geo":{"n":"Busan","la":35.102,"lo":129.03,"p":"approx"}},{"title":"'재정 빨대' 질문에 손사래 친 추미애…\"무릎 꿇고 사과하라\"","summary":"소방 예산을 '골치 아픈 재정 빨대'라고 표현한 추미애 경기도 지사가 거센 논란에 휩싸였습니다. 소방관들이 쓰러진